The package ggml provides CMake integration:

  find_package(ggml CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ggml::ggml)

Available vcpkg features:
  metal  - Metal GPU backend (macOS/iOS, auto-enabled on Apple)
  vulkan - Vulkan GPU backend
  cuda   - CUDA GPU backend
  opencl - OpenCL GPU backend
  webgpu - WebGPU GPU backend (Dawn; opt-in on every platform)

Hexagon is opt-in with ggml-speech[hexagon]. Set compatible HEXAGON_SDK_ROOT
and HEXAGON_TOOLS_ROOT on the build host. Stage every installed
libggml-htp-v*.so next to the application backends using its original name.
Requested Hexagon builds fail if DSP skeleton assets are absent.
